\",\"overview\":\"And relax... but Jacqui Joseph isn't feeling zen when it comes to saving a massage bed. Sarah Peterson might need a lie-down too, trying to save a tricky dining set.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pKdBbYcToZQQ7IQZAQ6f3KbM4ge.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-08-04\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Curveballs and Waves\",\"overview\":\"Are creative curves good for us? Katie and Sophie attempt a wavy redesign that leaves them feeling seasick.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lY9ho9A1rDBUNTnTLT6X41AKfb4.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-08-05\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Boiling Point!\",\"overview\":\"Kev's in hot water! Boiling, in fact, as he wrestles a rusty water tank. Jacqui tries to make a massive display unit fit for a modern home.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1a5Hw0VGrICgy1j5JtaGvPwaV1y.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-08-06\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"A Lot on Your Plate?\",\"overview\":\"Are old plates valuable? It's a smashing skip find for Sarah Moore, while carpenter Ollie tries to launder a tidy profit from an old washstand.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8f7HuiMLjQFh3HGAp6FnxvH4Dgj.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-08-10\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"The Right Wavelength\",\"overview\":\"'Broadsword calling Duncan. Come in with a plan. Over!' Duncan has a retro radio to save, and can newbie Tyler rescue a sewing machine table?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qTAcu9pQu6fmgEKEsgPnCN7HHvj.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-08-11\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"You Spin Me Round!\",\"overview\":\"Like a record, baby! JJ gets the oven fired up, trying to repurpose a record collection into something new.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9zejgccFEPlQDEozFM4jYQ4Nerc.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-08-12\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Make It Rain Cash\",\"overview\":\"With three items saved from Witley recycling centre in Surrey, upcycling expert Sarah Moore gets to work trying to turn trash into cash. For her own project, Sarah tries to make the sun shine a profit on a garden umbrella. and a pair of tired 70s armchairs puts upholsterer Larissa through her paces.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mxf2wTF7z3hylK4gwpuiv1Tt19D.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-08-13\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"Unleash the Bookcase Beast!\",\"overview\":\"A 'beast' of a bookcase poses a huge challenge for carpenter Sam, and Jacqui Joseph goes wild with patchwork.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xggZwX0tgFoWDTS2aiUkuOlZewi.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-08-17\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":14,\"name\":\"Bounce Back\",\"overview\":\"Bag maker Neil jumps at the chance to save an inflatable castle, but will working with the tricky material leaved him deflated?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iwtLrozWs6kj6D6MAnfMPZFV6j2.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-08-18\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":15,\"name\":\"Footing the Bill\",\"overview\":\"Salvage expert Guy has an out-there plan for some old shoe lasts, while Sarah Moore hangs her hopes on making cash from puncturing copper.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4vP4mBi0XaWSKiaz58N0rf4dN4R.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-08-19\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":16,\"name\":\"Woman with a Golden Gun - Not!\",\"overview\":\"Quick, change the plan! Will a disaster with a rug gun leave Sarah's chances of saving a 100-year-old rug in tatters?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bltJfwre6pNWg4L8vmlTdhEV1ke.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-08-20\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":17,\"name\":\"Ready to Rock!\",\"overview\":\"A mysterious wooden post turns up at the tip, and Jacqui Joseph tries to get a dated rocking chair back in full swing.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dpLAA7GMv3DO0tTsmnqvXMf96QN.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-08-24\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":18,\"name\":\"Worth the Candle?\",\"overview\":\"Sarah Moore risks getting her fingers burnt creating candlesticks from old spindles, and a last-minute change of plan by Simion throws the cat among the creative pigeons.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lBCfmPmRYGLMQc0uAkBETmOV2si.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-08-25\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":19,\"name\":\"It's Just Not Croquet!\",\"overview\":\"Saving old lawn bowls and a croquet set is far from fun and games for Guy, while upcyclers Katie and Sophie get brown furniture but need some bright ideas.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xJSxzvz4lLHvPbSbCf8qpS0Zunk.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-08-26\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":20,\"name\":\"The Worm Has Turned... Wood into Dust\",\"overview\":\"A woodworm-infested chair frame leaves husband-and-wife team Dani and Elliot with a huge job on their hands.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9VO7j7yG5Em8rJwkhHQ0cnu5Uhn.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-08-27\",\"runtime\":43}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2015-09-07\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}